{"id":28688,"author":"K_R_Cord","body":"Hello everyone,\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Social Media Team is welcoming new people to our team. We would like to expand our team in certain teams instead of others. This means that Graphics and Advertisement teams will not be a priority for the team. If you would like to join them, however, you can message me on discord if you feel you can benefit any team.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe would like to welcome people to make videos for us on the YouTube team, tweet out amazing tweets on our Twitter team, and take the next picture on our Instagram team. Below you will find the application format I would like from those that apply. If you do not have experience that is alright. What I am looking for is a good attitude. If you work well as a team, have a positive impact and try hard, you will probably be selected.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eApplication Formats:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYouTube-\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eMinecraft Username:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eDiscord ID:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eIn 1 or 2 sentences, tell me who you are:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eWhat is your Youtube channel?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eWhat software do you use when recording videos?\u003cbr\u003eDo you have experience editing videos?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eDo you have any experience using other video\u0026nbsp;sites?\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eHave you ever marketed something using Youtube before?\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eWhat is a weakness you know you have?\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eTwitter-\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eMinecraft Username:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eDiscord ID:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eIn 1 or 2 sentences, tell me who you are.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eWhat is your Twit